<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Mulish:ital,wght@0,800;1,800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <title>Nicol Leon - Marina Samuels - Animation </title>
    <style>
        body{
            background-color: #0d1b2a;
            margin: 0;
        }


        h1, h4, p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #e0e1dd;
        }

        h1{
            font-size: 4vw;
        }

        .mulish {
            font-family: "Mulish", sans-serif;
            font-optical-sizing: auto;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-style: normal;
        }

        div {
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 20px;
        max-width: 1200px;
        min-width: 320px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .big-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .headline-container {
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            display: block;
        }

        .BYLINE{
            font-style: italic;
            margin: 40px;
        }

        .intro{
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 1200px;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .database {
            background-color: #a9d6e5;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .datainfo{
            color: black;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .search-bar {
        background-color: #0d1b2a;
        padding: 20px;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .input-group {
            flex: 1 1 200px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0%;
        }

        .search-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .button-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .search-button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .search-button:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }

        .intro_text{
            text-align: justify;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

    </style>

</head>
<body>
    <div class="big-container">

        <div class="top">
            
            <div class="headline-container">
            <h1 class="mulish">Workers at Risk: Exposing Deadly Injuries at Companies</h1>
            <p class="BYLINE">by Nicol Leon and Marina Samuels. Updated April 2025</p>
            </div>

            <div class="intro">
            <p class="intro_text">This search tool, based on an OSHA database, locates on a map the companies where workers suffered severe injuries, across the United States, such as amputations, hospitalizations requiring in-patient care, or the loss of an eye, between January 2015 and July 2024.
            </p>
            <br>
            <br>
                <div class="database">
                <p class="datainfo">This database, called "Severe Injury Reports," was collected by OSHA under Law 29-CFR 1904.39, which requires businesses to report these occurrences in their workplaces.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        <div class="search-bar">
                <div class="input-group">
                  <input type="text" placeholder="Zip Code" class="search-input" />
                </div>
              
                <div class="input-group">
                  <input type="text" placeholder="Company" class="search-input" />
                </div>
              
                <div class="input-group">
                  <input type="text" placeholder="Industry" class="search-input" />
                </div>
              
                <div class="button-group">
                  <button class="search-button">Search</button>
                </div>
              </div>
        </div>